    - target: {fileID: 5527874617902343086, guid: 54e52d981b7c70d4fa5153daed769b2e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Superposition isn\u2019t chaos. It\u2019s possibility. If this works
        the Earth network could finally complete the quantum lattice. With the lattice
        active, their supercomputer won\u2019t just predict famine zones, it\u2019ll
        design crops for them. Engineer ecosystems. Optimize water cycles. Solve
        problems we don\u2019t even understand yet."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
